      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/lillian-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The International and Great Northern Railroad laid tracks through the area in 1902, sparking the town’s early growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mansfieldtexas.gov/1400/Lillian"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Two cotton gins once operated in Lillian, reflecting its early agricultural economy.",
