      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mansfieldtexas.gov/1400/Lillian"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1917 a fire swept through the south side, destroying most of the buildings there.",
